# The Python bindings take every check of the parent file but two, whose findings fall inside nanobind's own
# headers, where no NOLINT can reach (ADR-0089): bugprone-exception-escape flags nanobind's noexcept wrap_move for
# model classes whose moves copy their collections, and the analyzer's NullDereference flags nanobind's list
# caster on a path it cannot rule out.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-exception-escape,
  -clang-analyzer-core.NullDereference
